<!--
  Material Symbols Outlined "repeat_one", Apache-2.0.
  Source: symbols/web/repeat_one/materialsymbolsoutlined/repeat_one_24px.svg

  Filled white rather than tinted, for the reason spelled out in
  `ic_orientation_landscape.xml`: Media3's controller buttons set no
  `android:tint`, so each icon carries its own colour and a black one would
  vanish into the controller's dark scrim.

  Shown when the play mode is "repeat one": the current item plays again and
  again and the rest of the list is never reached. It is the loop of
  `ic_mode_repeat_all.xml` with a "1" sitting inside it, which is exactly the
  distinction between the two modes — the same circle, a different number of
  items travelling round it.
-->
